26391	26463	26373	26374	the stranger	1869	“ They say ‘ tis the trunk beneath whose branches the monks encamped when they came to this valley to raise their building . It was their house , till with the wood and stone around them , their labour and their fine art , they piled up their abbey . And then they were driven out of it , and it came to this . Poor men ! poor men ! ”
