107170	107182	107184	107184	Morley	431	“ This letter is I believe addressed to you , Sir , ”
107238	107248	107250	107252	the strange gentleman	4221	“ Sir , I am extremely obliged to you , ”
107254	107359	107250	107252	the strange gentleman	4221	“ the letter belongs to me , though it is not addressed to me . I must have this moment dropped it . My name , Sir , is Firebrace -- Sir Vavasour Firebrace , and this letter is addressed to a -- a -- not exactly my lawyer , but a gentleman -- a professional gentleman -- whom I am in the habit of frequently seeing ; daily , I may say . He is employed in a great question in which I am deeply interested . Sir , I am vastly obliged to you , and I trust that you are satisfied . ”
107360	107368	107370	107370	Morley	431	“ Oh I perfectly , Sir Vavasour ; ”
107382	107397	107399	107399	Morley	431	“ Do you happen to know a lawyer by name Hatton in this Inn ? ”
